<title>USA: Medusa Corp Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Medusa Corp Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	Nine Months</p>
<p>			   Ended September 30,  Ended September 30,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p>				     (in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p> Net sales		$109,295 $ 94,827   $240,363   $220,612</p>
<p>Depreciation and amortization</p>
<p>				 4,379    5,021     12,332     11,881</p>
<p>Selling and administrative</p>
<p>				 6,477    5,621     18,977     17,119</p>
<p> Operating profit	 32,782   26,375     57,770     48,256</p>
<p> Interest expense	(1,022)  (1,907)    (3,015)    (5,682)</p>
<p> Income before taxes    32,118   24,997     55,608     43,918</p>
<p>Provision for income taxes</p>
<p>				10,024    8,624     17,353     15,152</p>
<p> Net Income	     22,094  16,373(b)  38,255(a)  28,776(b)</p>
<p> Average shares	 15,946   16,014     16,034     16,005</p>
<p> Primary shr		  1.38     1.01	 2.37	 1.78</p>
<p> Fully diluted shr	  1.27	.95	 2.23	 1.70</p>
<p>NOTES: a) includes one-time pretax charge of $1.2 million or $0.04 fully diluted per common share for early retirement incentive package costs.</p>
<p>(b) includes one-time pretax charge of $1.3 million or $0.05 fully diluted per share got closure of dredging operation.</p>
